      "values:originalText": "the final outcome of the proceedings to the Secretary-General of the United\nNations, who shall transmit the information to the other States Parties.",
      "skos:definition": "the final outcome of the proceedings to the Secretary-General of the United\nNations, who shall transmit the information to the other States Parties.",
