      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to this section, this Act commences at the later of the following\ntimes:\n\n\nEndnotes\n\nEndnote 3—Legislation history\n\nCrimes (Internationally Protected Persons) Act 1976\nCompilation date: 10/3/16\nRegistered: 26/5/16\n\n(a) immediately after the commencement of item 15 of Schedule 1 to the\nCriminal Code Amendment (Theft, Fraud, Bribery and Related\nOffences) Act 2000;\n\nItem 15 commenced on 24 May 2001.\n\n\nEndnotes\n\nEndnote 4—Amendment history\n\nCrimes (Internationally Protected Persons) Act 1976\n\nCompilation date: 10/3/16\nRegistered: 26/5/16\n\nEndnote 4—Amendment history\n\nProvision affected\nHow affected\ns. 3 ............................................ am. No. 120, 1987; No. 63, 1988; No. 196, 1992; No. 58, 1995; No. 5,\n2011; No. 136, 2012\ns. 3A ......................................... ad. No. 58, 1995\ns. 6 ............................................ am. No. 120, 1987\ns. 6A ......................................... ad. No. 24, 2001\ns. 8 ............................................ am. No. 120, 1987; No. 11, 1990; No. 24, 2001; No. 4, 2010; No 4, 2016\ns. 9 ............................................ rep. No. 120, 1987\ns. 11 .......................................... am. No. 155, 1979; No. 70, 1980; No. 120, 1987\ns. 12 .......................................... am. No. 120, 1987\ns. 13 .......................................... rs. No. 182, 1994\n\nam. No. 5, 2011\nHeading to s. 14 ........................ am. No. 5, 2011\ns. 14 .......................................... rs. No. 182, 1994\n\nam. No. 5, 2011\ns. 17 .......................................... am. No. 120, 1987\n\nrep. No. 58, 1995",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Subject to this section, this Act commences at the later of the following\ntimes:\n\n\nEndnotes\n\nEndnote 3—Legislation history\n\nCrimes (Internationally Protected Persons) Act 1976\nCompilation date: 10/3/16\nRegistered: 26/5/16\n\n(a) immediately after the commencement of item 15 of Schedule 1 to the\nCriminal Code Amendment (Theft, Fraud, Bribery and Related\nOffences) Act 2000;\n\nItem 15 commenced on 24 May 2001.\n\n\nEndnotes\n\nEndnote 4—Amendment history\n\nCrimes (Internationally Protected Persons) Act 1976\n\nCompilation date: 10/3/16\nRegistered: 26/5/16\n\nEndnote 4—Amendment history\n\nProvision affected\nHow affected\ns. 3 ............................................ am. No. 120, 1987; No. 63, 1988; No. 196, 1992; No. 58, 1995; No. 5,\n2011; No. 136, 2012\ns. 3A ......................................... ad. No. 58, 1995\ns. 6 ............................................ am. No. 120, 1987\ns. 6A ......................................... ad. No. 24, 2001\ns. 8 ............................................ am. No. 120, 1987; No. 11, 1990; No. 24, 2001; No. 4, 2010; No 4, 2016\ns. 9 ............................................ rep. No. 120, 1987\ns. 11 .......................................... am. No. 155, 1979; No. 70, 1980; No. 120, 1987\ns. 12 .......................................... am. No. 120, 1987\ns. 13 .......................................... rs. No. 182, 1994\n\nam. No. 5, 2011\nHeading to s. 14 ........................ am. No. 5, 2011\ns. 14 .......................................... rs. No. 182, 1994\n\nam. No. 5, 2011\ns. 17 .......................................... am. No. 120, 1987\n\nrep. No. 58, 1995",
